        "text": "10"
      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "text": "8"
      },
      {
        "key": "E",
        "text": "6"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "The shaded region is a trapezium",
        "body": "The shaded region is a trapezium with horizontal parallel sides. The top side is $PM$, which is half of the side of a square, so $1$ cm. The bottom side is the whole bottom row of three squares, $6$ cm. Its height is two squares, $4$ cm. Area $=\\frac12(1+6)\\cdot4=14$ cm$^2$.\n\n**Answer: (A) 14**"
      }
    ],
