        "text": "60"
      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "text": "50"
      },
      {
        "key": "E",
        "text": "40"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "C",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Equation",
        "body": "Let there be $x$ boys and $100-x$ girls. Then $0.4x=0.5(100-x)+4$, so $0.9x=54$ and $x=60$.\n\n**Answer: (C) 60**"
      },
      {
        "title": "Check the options",
        "body": "With $60$ boys: $0.4\\cdot60=24$ boys and $0.5\\cdot40=20$ girls scored A, a difference of $4$. ✓\n\n**Answer: (C) 60**"
      }
